                                                "sense_id": "87bedcd4-0d3e-3bfb-85a3-a2e54307e131",
                                                "text": "\"Pretty little thing, isn't she?\" said Mrs. Budge huskily, and panted two or three times. \"Yes,\" Denis nodded agreement. Sixteen, slender, but nubile, he said to himself, and laid up the phrase in his memory as a happy one."
